+
+### Angular Version & Architecture
+
+- Angular 21.2 with the `@angular/build:application` builder, and `strict` plus `strictTemplates` stay on so type errors fail the build (`tsconfig.json`).
+- The app is zoneless (no `zone.js`, no `provideZoneChangeDetection`), so changing view state is held in signals (`src/app/checkout.page.ts`).
+- Components are standalone with no NgModules or barrel files, in a flat `src/app/` using `.page.ts`, `.store.ts`, `.service.ts` and `.data.ts` suffixes.
+- Dependencies are injected with `inject()`, never through constructors (`src/app/checkout.page.ts`).
+- Routes are eagerly loaded; a page that reads the cart goes inside the `''` group that provides `CartStore`, every other page outside it (`src/app/app.routes.ts`).
+
+### Component Design & Forms
+
+- Components use inline templates with `@if`/`@for`, tracking list items by id (`src/app/cart.page.ts`).
+- Selectors use the `app` prefix, with elements in kebab-case, enforced by lint (`eslint.config.js`).
+- No existing component sets `changeDetection` (DEBT-005); new components set `OnPush` as `docs/defaults.md` requires on v21.
+- Forms are reactive and typed through `FormBuilder.nonNullable`, with validators declared on the control (`src/app/checkout.page.ts`).
+
+### State, RxJS & API
+
+- Shared state is a signal store (private writable signal, `asReadonly()` exposure, `computed` totals, immutable updates) with no state library (`src/app/cart.store.ts`).
+- HTTP calls live in a `providedIn: 'root'` service with typed request and response, called by relative `/api` URL; there are no interceptors or environment files (`src/app/order.service.ts`).
+- The order POST subscription handles `next` and `error`; cancelling it on destroy would skip the cart clear for a sent order, so decide that explicitly (`src/app/checkout.page.ts`).
+
+### Typing, Styling & SSR
+
+- Data shapes are exported interfaces and `src/` uses no `any` (`src/app/order.service.ts`).
+- Styling is plain CSS with the global sheet `src/styles.css`; no component styles exist.
+- There is no SSR or hydration setup (`angular.json`).
+
+### Testing
 
-_Not yet populated. Until you run `/bootstrap`, the greenfield defaults in [docs/defaults.md](./docs/defaults.md) apply. After bootstrap, this section becomes the authoritative source._
+- Specs run on Vitest through `@angular/build:unit-test` with jsdom, beside their source (`angular.json`, `tsconfig.spec.json`).
+- Specs use `TestBed` with the real store, assert DOM or state, and mock only HTTP with `provideHttpClientTesting`; component specs await `fixture.whenStable()` (`src/app/checkout.page.spec.ts`).
+- A spec for anything reading the cart lists `CartStore` in its providers, because the store has no `providedIn` (`src/app/products.page.spec.ts`).
+- Target shape: trophy-shaped, with component specs as the centre, a few store and service specs, and no E2E harness today.
 
