+## DEBT-001: Checkout can send the same order twice
+
+- **Key**: checkout::no-in-flight-guard
+- **Category**: Architecture
+- **Severity**: High
+- **Effort**: S
+- **Files**: `src/app/checkout.page.ts:31`, `src/app/checkout.page.ts:50-65`, `api/server.mjs:20-24`
+
+### Issue
+The button is disabled only while the form is invalid and `submit()` tracks no pending state. A second submit before the response sends a second POST, and the API creates a new order for each.
+
+### Recommended fix
+Track a pending signal, ignore submits and disable the button while it is set, and reset it on error. Write the failing spec first.
+
+---
+
+## DEBT-002: Empty cart can be ordered
+
+- **Key**: checkout::empty-cart-accepted
+- **Category**: Architecture
+- **Severity**: High
+- **Effort**: S
+- **Files**: `src/app/checkout.page.ts:50-59`, `api/server.mjs:20-24`
+
+### Issue
+`submit()` checks only form validity, so a valid form with an empty cart posts `lines: []`, which the API stores.
+
+### Recommended fix
+Block submission with no lines in the page and reject it in the API.
+
+---
+
+## DEBT-003: Order submit path has no spec
+
+- **Key**: checkout::submit-path-untested
+- **Category**: Testing
+- **Severity**: High
+- **Effort**: S
+- **Files**: `src/app/checkout.page.spec.ts:1-37`, `src/app/checkout.page.ts:50-65`
+
+### Issue
+The checkout specs cover the summary and the email message only. Nothing pins the posted lines, the cart clear and navigation on success, or the failure message.
+
+### Recommended fix
+Add component specs for success and failure using `HttpTestingController`.
+
+---
+
+## DEBT-004: Order success clears the whole cart
+
+- **Key**: checkout::late-success-clears-cart
+- **Category**: State Management
+- **Severity**: Medium
+- **Effort**: M
+- **Files**: `src/app/checkout.page.ts:53-63`
+
+### Issue
+Lines are captured before the POST, but success clears the whole cart and navigates even if the user has left checkout. Items added while the request is in flight would be lost.
+
+### Recommended fix
+Decide the intended behaviour first, then remove only ordered quantities or lock the cart while pending.
+
+---
+
+## DEBT-005: Components do not set OnPush
+
+- **Key**: components::eager-change-detection
+- **Category**: Performance
+- **Severity**: Low
+- **Effort**: S
+- **Files**: `src/app/app.ts`, `src/app/products.page.ts`, `src/app/cart.page.ts`, `src/app/checkout.page.ts`, `src/app/confirmation.page.ts`, `src/app/help.page.ts`
+
+### Issue
+None of the six components sets `changeDetection`, which on Angular 21 means eager checking.
+
+### Recommended fix
+Switch one component at a time and verify the view still updates.
+
+---
+
+## DEBT-006: Name and address give no validation message
+
+- **Key**: checkout::missing-field-errors
+- **Category**: Component Design
+- **Severity**: Low
