+---
+name: local-order-api
+description: Config shows local order placement needs the API stub started separately and the dev proxy from npm start
+type: gotcha
+scope: api/**, proxy.conf.json, package.json
+status: unverified
+last-verified: never
+---
+`npm start` runs `ng serve --proxy-config proxy.conf.json`, which forwards `/api` to `http://localhost:4301`. No package script starts `api/server.mjs`, and `angular.json` names no proxy file, so a plain `ng serve` has no `/api` proxy.
